      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/aragon_new_mexico",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1880 Buffalo Soldiers built a stockade at the fort site, and Sergeant George Jordan earned a Medal of Honor for repulsing over 100 Indians.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
